    "problem_statement": "A devicetree API for non-volatile-memory (NVMEM) consumers is missing. There should be compile-time devicetree helpers to query, by index or by name, the nvmem-cells phandle-array of a consumer node: test whether a given index or name exists, count the cells, retrieve the referenced cell node by index, by name, or the first cell, and obtain the parent memory controller (MTD) device node of a cell. The tests define an NVMEM consumer node and a fixed-layout NVMEM provider with two cells (one read-only), and exercise these helpers, including their DT_INST_* instance variants, against the expected node paths and counts.",
